A piece of my mind, the `Fit` is designed as follows: 

```go
type Fit struct {
	ResourceSelector ResourceSelector
}

type ResourceSelector struct {
	MatchExpressions []ResourceSelectorRequirement
}

type ResourceSelectorRequirement struct {
	Key      string
	Operator ResourceSelectorOperator
	Values   []string
}

type ResourceSelectorOperator string
const (
	ResourceSelectorOpIn           ResourceSelectorOperator = "In"
	ResourceSelectorOpNotIn        ResourceSelectorOperator = "NotIn"
)
```

`ResourceSelectorOpIn` describes the `Key` is a subset of one of `Values`, example: `Values` is `[]string{"example.com"}`, the `Key` could be either `example.com/rc` or `sub.example.com/rc`.
